A '''Golden Gift''' is a {{Special}} item obtained from {{Item|Green Gift}}s and {{Item|Red Gift}}s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Gifts ===
A '''Golden Gift''' has a {{Chance|0.03%|1|3251.5|gifts}} chance to drop from {{Item|Green Gift}}s and a {{Chance|0.13%|1|775.3|gifts}} chance to drop from {{Item|Red Gift}}s. 

== Usage ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
A {{Item|Gold Gift Talisman}} can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Einary}} at {{Zone|Einary's Emporium}} in [[Jerry's Workshop]] during the month of December.
